I recovered about 45 seconds of frames. Firefox repeatedly disappears behind the terminal after taskbar clicks, stays on its session-recovery page, and never reaches the requested site. The visible logs also show repeated clicks on the same taskbar target and long decision pauses.

I’ll add non-toggling window activation, strengthen post-action observation handling, and make interrupted recordings playable. The original video will remain untouched.
