[0m
The fixes pass the test suite. Window activation now waits for X11 to confirm that Firefox is active and visible, and it cannot share a batch with typing. The observation loop adds a settling interval and waits for multiple fresh frames; recordings now use interruption-tolerant MP4 fragments.

The recovered frames also show long idle pauses and dropped-frame counters. These changes reduce avoidable interaction and recording problems, but remote-model latency remains.
